  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong>本模组仅适用于 1.20.4 - 1.21.1。适用于 NeoForge 的更新版本已<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-ocean-monuments\" rel=\"nofollow\">转移至此</a>。</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4IgKuSq.png\" alt=\"YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"Depends on YUNG&#x27;s API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入 YUNG GANG Discord 服务器！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"在 Twitter 上关注我！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"订阅我的 YouTube 频道！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qs5CKD3.png\" alt=\"What is this?\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;对 Minecraft 海洋神殿进行全面重制！YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments 从根本上重新设计了海洋神殿，使其更加引人入胜且回报丰厚。优化后的神殿比原版大得多，且具有完全随机的布局。你将获得更丰厚的战利品，包括三叉戟和深海之心！</p>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QavgJ5oL5SI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/61NjpSv.png\" alt=\"Compatibility\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments 旨在与所有世界生成模组完全兼容，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-desert-temples-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Desert Temples</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-witch-huts-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Witch Huts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Extras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-bridges-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Bridges</a></li>\n<li>Terralith、Biomes O' Plenty、Oh The Biomes You'll Go 等</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用优惠码 YUNGNICKYOUNG 在 Bisect Hosting 享受 25% 折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
